    "auto_merge": {
        "commit_message": "In extension types, as a special attribute, `__dict__` shouldn't be\ndeclared as `public` or `readonly` (similar to `__weakref__`). Currently\nCython compiler does not check this restriction, and code such as\n\n```\ncdef class C:\n    cdef public dict __dict__\n```\n\ngenerates code failed to compile due to redefinition errors.\n\nThis commit adds a compiler error for this case, so users can identify\nthe mistake quickly with a clearer diagnostic.",
        "commit_title": "Generate error when special attribute __dict__ is declared as public or readonly (#7823)",
